{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"921a220806f68d66de57b27dd59223eb1b066e8d56be04c3105a8636a6e23e70","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":46,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"彼勒屈身，尼波彎腰；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴比倫的偶像馱在獸和牲畜上。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們所抬的如今成了重馱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使牲畜疲乏，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都一同彎腰屈身，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不能保全重馱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"自己倒被擄去。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"雅各家，以色列家一切餘剩的要聽我言：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們自從生下，就蒙我保抱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"自從出胎，便蒙我懷搋。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"直到你們年老，我仍這樣；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"直到你們髮白，我仍懷搋。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我已造作，也必保抱；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必懷抱，也必拯救。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"你們將誰與我相比，與我同等，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"可以與我比較，使我們相同呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那從囊中抓金子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用天平平銀子的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雇銀匠製造神像，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們又俯伏，又叩拜。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們將神像抬起，扛在肩上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"安置在定處，它就站立，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不離本位；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人呼求它，它不能答應，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不能救人脫離患難。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"你們當想念這事，自己作大丈夫。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"悖逆的人哪，要心裏思想。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要追念上古的事。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我是上帝，並無別神；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我是上帝，再沒有能比我的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我從起初指明末後的事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從古時言明未成的事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"說：我的籌算必立定；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凡我所喜悅的，我必成就。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我召鷙鳥從東方來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"召那成就我籌算的人從遠方來。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我已說出，也必成就；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我已謀定，也必做成。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們這些心中頑梗、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"遠離公義的，當聽我言。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我使我的公義臨近，必不遠離。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的救恩必不遲延；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要為以色列－我的榮耀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在錫安施行救恩。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/46.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/47.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/45.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}